@@ -26,5 +26,17 @@ rentals.quote({
 
 The end timestamp is the start of the day after the final rental day. Bookings for the same item may
 be adjacent but cannot overlap. Quotes and bookings reject unknown equipment and invalid periods.
+Use `availability()` to see the equipment free for an entire valid period. Its optional `kind` filters
+the result, and returned equipment ids are sorted:
+
+```ts
+rentals.availability({
+  start: '2026-06-10T00:00:00Z',
+  end: '2026-06-13T00:00:00Z',
+  kind: 'board',
+});
+// ['board-1']
+```
+
 Cancellation is not yet exposed; when it is added, bookings cancelled less than 24 hours before their
 start will receive no refund, and all other cancellations will receive a full refund.
